# Modelfile — unity-local
#
# ⛔ DELIBERATELY NO `SYSTEM` LINE. Her persona is `Unity1.txt`, sent live by
# server.mjs on every message. Baking it in here would mean rebuilding the model
# every time the file is edited, and a blob you cannot read is a persona you
# cannot audit. The file on disk is the source of truth.
#
# dolphin3:8b is the uncensored base (already pulled). Sampling parameters are
# carried over from the existing `unity` model, where they were tuned.
#
# Build:  ollama create unity-local -f Modelfile   (start.bat does this once)

FROM dolphin3:8b

PARAMETER temperature 1.05
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.08
# 32k leaves room for a ~11k-token persona plus a long conversation. The base
# supports 131072 if you want more history — raise it here and rebuild.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
